---
layout: layout.njk
permalink: careers.html
canonical: "careers.html"
active: "careers"
---
{%- set pg = pages[active] %}
<section class="page-head">
  <div class="single" style="background-image:url('{{ pg.background }}')"></div><div class="grad"></div>
  <div class="wrap">
    <span class="page-chip"><img src="assets/img/logo-investments.png" alt="Zuwa Investments Limited"></span>
    <h1>{{ pg.heading | safe }}</h1>
    <p class="lead">{{ pg.lead | safe }}</p>
    <div class="breadcrumb"><a href="index.html">Home</a> &nbsp;/&nbsp; Careers at Zuwa</div>
  </div>
</section>
<section class="section soft">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="center" style="max-width:760px;margin:0 auto 30px">
      <span class="eyebrow reveal">Why Zuwa</span>
      <h2 class="reveal d1">Build a career worth putting your name on</h2>
      <p class="lead center reveal d2">The strength of our group is the strength of our people. We invest in them, and we grow together.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="grid-auto">
      <div class="feat ac-blue reveal"><div class="ficon"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.7"><circle cx="9" cy="8" r="3.2"/><path d="M3.5 19a5.5 5.5 0 0 1 11 0"/><path d="M16 5.5a3 3 0 0 1 0 5.8M16.5 19a5.5 5.5 0 0 0-2.3-4.4"/></svg></div><h3>Training and development</h3><p>Every team member completes our internal training programme before stepping in front of a client, and keeps developing on the job.</p></div>
      <div class="feat ac-sky reveal d1"><div class="ficon"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.7"><path d="M12 3v4M12 17v4M3 12h4M17 12h4M6 6l2.5 2.5M15.5 15.5 18 18M18 6l-2.5 2.5M8.5 15.5 6 18"/></svg></div><h3>Room to grow</h3><p>We promote from within and invest in careers. As the group grows, so do the people who build it.</p></div>
      <div class="feat ac-gold reveal d2"><div class="ficon"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.7"><circle cx="12" cy="10" r="6"/><path d="M8.5 15.5 7 21l5-2.5L17 21l-1.5-5.5"/><path d="M9.5 10l1.7 1.7L15 8"/></svg></div><h3>Dignified work</h3><p>Every trade under our banner is dignified work. We treat every team member with respect, on site and off.</p></div>
      <div class="feat ac-navy reveal"><div class="ficon"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.7"><path d="M12 3l7 3v5c0 4.5-3 8-7 10-4-2-7-5.5-7-10V6z"/><path d="M9 12l2 2 4-4"/></svg></div><h3>Stable and compliant</h3><p>A locally owned, compliant employer. Fair dealings, branded uniforms, identification, and work you can be proud of.</p></div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="center" style="margin-bottom:30px">
      <span class="eyebrow reveal">Where we hire</span>
      <h2 class="reveal d1">Roles across the group</h2>
      <p class="lead center reveal d2">We regularly recruit across all three companies and our support functions. If your skills fit, we would like to hear from you.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="grid-auto">
      <div class="feat ac-orange reveal"><div class="ficon"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.7"><path d="M3 21h18M5 21V9l5-3 5 3v12M9 21v-4h2v4"/><path d="M15 21V11l4 2v8"/></svg></div><h3>Construction trades</h3><p>Bricklayers, carpenters, plumbers, electricians, painters, tilers and general workers.</p></div>
      <div class="feat ac-blue reveal d1"><div class="ficon"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.7"><circle cx="12" cy="10" r="6"/><path d="M8.5 15.5 7 21l5-2.5L17 21l-1.5-5.5"/><path d="M9.5 10l1.7 1.7L15 8"/></svg></div><h3>Site supervision and engineering</h3><p>Site engineers, project supervisors, quantity surveyors and foremen.</p></div>
      <div class="feat ac-sky reveal d2"><div class="ficon"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.7"><path d="M12 3v4M12 17v4M3 12h4M17 12h4M6 6l2.5 2.5M15.5 15.5 18 18M18 6l-2.5 2.5M8.5 15.5 6 18"/></svg></div><h3>Cleaning teams and supervisors</h3><p>Post-construction and contract cleaning operatives, team leaders and site supervisors.</p></div>
      <div class="feat ac-gold reveal"><div class="ficon"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.7"><path d="M3 7.5 12 3l9 4.5v9L12 21l-9-4.5z"/><path d="M3 7.5 12 12l9-4.5M12 12v9"/></svg></div><h3>Supply and logistics</h3><p>Procurement officers, store controllers, drivers and delivery crew.</p></div>
      <div class="feat ac-navy reveal d1"><div class="ficon"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.7"><circle cx="9" cy="8" r="3.2"/><path d="M3.5 19a5.5 5.5 0 0 1 11 0"/><path d="M16 5.5a3 3 0 0 1 0 5.8M16.5 19a5.5 5.5 0 0 0-2.3-4.4"/></svg></div><h3>Office and support</h3><p>Administration, finance, health and safety, and client service roles across the group.</p></div>
      <div class="feat ac-orange reveal d2"><div class="ficon"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.7"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="8.5"/><path d="M12 7.5V12l3 2"/></svg></div><h3>Attachments and internships</h3><p>Opportunities for students and graduates to gain hands on experience with a growing group.</p></div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

{%- if collections.jobs.length %}
<section class="section soft" id="vacancies">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="center" style="margin-bottom:30px">
      <span class="eyebrow reveal">Open positions</span>
      <h2 class="reveal d1">Vacancies</h2>
      <p class="lead center reveal d2">Apply by email with your CV and the role in the subject line.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="grid-auto">
      {%- set jac = ["ac-blue", "ac-orange", "ac-sky", "ac-navy", "ac-gold"] %}
      {%- for j in collections.jobs %}
      <div class="feat reveal">
        <div class="ficon {{ jac[loop.index0 % 5] }}"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><path d="M20 7h-4V5a2 2 0 0 0-2-2h-4a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v2H4a1 1 0 0 0-1 1v11a1 1 0 0 0 1 1h16a1 1 0 0 0 1-1V8a1 1 0 0 0-1-1zM10 5h4v2h-4z"/></svg></div>
        <h3>{{ j.data.role }}</h3>
        <p>{{ j.data.summary }}</p>
        <p class="k">{{ j.data.business }}{% if j.data.location %} &middot; {{ j.data.location }}{% endif %}{% if j.data.type %} &middot; {{ j.data.type }}{% endif %}</p>
        <a class="btn btn-primary" href="mailto:{{ company.email }}?subject={{ j.data.role | urlencode }}">Apply for this role</a>
      </div>
      {%- endfor %}
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
{%- endif %}


<section class="section soft">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="center" style="margin-bottom:30px">
      <span class="eyebrow reveal">How to apply</span>
      <h2 class="reveal d1">Four simple steps</h2>
    </div>
    <div class="steps steps-4 roadmap reveal">
      <div class="pstep reveal"><div class="pn">1</div><h3>Prepare</h3><p>Update your CV and a short note on the role and company that interest you.</p></div>
      <div class="pstep reveal d1"><div class="pn">2</div><h3>Send</h3><p>Email it to us with the role in the subject line so we can route it to the right team.</p></div>
      <div class="pstep reveal d2"><div class="pn">3</div><h3>Review</h3><p>We review applications and contact suitable candidates to arrange an interview.</p></div>
      <div class="pstep reveal d1"><div class="pn">4</div><h3>Onboarding</h3><p>Successful candidates complete our induction and training before their first client.</p></div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="cta reveal">
      <div class="cbg" style="background-image:url('assets/img/hardhat-blueprint.jpg')"></div><div class="cgr"></div>
      <span class="eyebrow sky">Join the team</span>
      <h2>Send us your CV</h2>
      <p class="lead center">Email your CV and a short cover note, with the role and company in the subject line. We review every application.</p>
      <div style="display:flex;gap:14px;justify-content:center;flex-wrap:wrap;margin-top:12px">
        <a class="btn btn-primary" href="mailto:info@zuwainvestments.com?subject=Career%20application%20-%20Zuwa">Apply by email <span class="arw">&rarr;</span></a>
        <a class="btn btn-outline" href="contact.html">Contact us</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>